---
title: Buttermilk Pancakes
servings: 4
course: breakfast
---

Whisk the @flour{200%g} and @baking powder{2%tsp} together in a #large bowl{}.

In a second bowl beat the @eggs{2} into the @buttermilk{300%ml}.

Pour the wet into the dry and fold until barely combined. Rest the batter for ~{15%minutes}.

Melt @butter{1%tbsp} in a #skillet{} over medium heat and cook each pancake for ~{2%minutes} a side.

Serve with @maple syrup{}.
